{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/02/1832681/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/02/1832681/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんとお肉食べに行きたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしいところ知ってそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/02/1832681/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はついに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TOKYO GIRLS COLLECTION"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京ガールズコレクション"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TGC"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張します！とても！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも楽しんで頑張りたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデルのお仕事をしてる姿を\n皆さんに見てもらえることが\n嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ランウェイ後は\n乃木坂46のライブもあるので\n楽しみにしていてくださいねっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/02/1832681/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/02/1832681/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この雲の多い感じ\n天候が読めない感じの雲\nすき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/02/1832681/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！本日は\n幕張メッセで\n乃木坂46 セブン-イレブン限定ミニライブイベント\nがありました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリはまだ秘密ですが\n私はすごく好き！このセットリスト！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしかったよ～ライブはやっぱり楽しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブしてて思うのは\nもっとダンスも歌も上手くなって\n前で踊りたいってことです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も自分が参加してない楽曲の時に\n裏で皆さんが表から見てるスクリーンを\n裏から見てて先輩方の\n表情とか踊りをみてたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私には足りてないことがたくさんあるし\nだからこそまだまだ伸ばせるところがあるから\n頑張ろうって思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の\n乃木坂46 セブン-イレブン限定ミニライブイベントは名古屋会場であります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださる方は楽しみにしていてくださいねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/02/1832681/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/02/1832681/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レインコートは青を選びました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなのとっていいよっていうときは\n青をとってるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の秋ごろから青が\nラッキカラーな気がする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/09/02/1832681/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}